      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your feelings of hopelessness and exhaustion are incredibly painful to witness, and it is often the mind that distorts hope in such despair. While the pain of feeling abandoned by help is real, please consider that taking a break is not the only option and that support is still there for you. I am not a doctor, so I encourage you to try a 24/7 suicide crisis hotline to find a real person who can offer help for you when you are feeling desperate.",
